Cell["Doubling sees the shape of a ball", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c862b1ab-2b0a-4db8-9518-a0bfc0673da8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A different reading covers ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"2", 
     StyleBox["r", "TI"]}]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9cd534de-cfb8-4299-8a65-ab1bba24dd95"],
 " by balls of radius ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["r", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d542756-bbb1-4455-a152-306c5af87aff"],
 " and takes the base-two logarithm of the count."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"320412fd-ba5c-4289-b663-6f98f0222ff8"],

Cell["\<\
The square tiling admits a small exact cover. The mesh uses more balls in the \
greedy cover even though both substrates have planar growth dimension.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6b4c5e56-e8d2-4388-8b6c-d9f9590f1551"],

Cell["\<\
A Euclidean disc cannot tile a doubled disc without overlap. Doubling sees \
this covering overhead as well as the dimension. The greedy mesh count is an \
upper bound; it does not prove that no smaller cover exists.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"cd829f21-8b49-4ba8-a4fd-896dd6513661"],

Cell["\<\
The exact square-tiling counts and the greedy mesh counts, computed over \
interior scales. The pictures show one scale, with each ball in its own \
colour.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5412a439-952a-49e1-a301-491f4448516d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", " ", "2", " ", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"square", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"InfraSubstrate", "[", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<SquareTilingGraph\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Small\>\"", ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<KeepCoordinates\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]}], " ", 
       "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{"mesh", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"dimensionSubstrates", "[", 
